Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a guy that gathered\N100 coins and got special powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he's incredibly powerful, and he's\Nprotecting the coins around crash site.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we've got to do something about him\Nif we want to snatch those coins, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we made this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care, as long as I get my cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be a fun way to kill some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Naoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to know a lot about this guy.\NHave you met him before or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Naoto and I's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an old friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A few months earlier"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A few months earlier"\NAiko's been acting weird lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A few months earlier"\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are a couple, right?\NDid you get in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We went and saw a movie together last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's no problem, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, something just feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I feel like she's a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "a different person"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot has happened lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko... I haven't seen her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the others, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Brings back memories, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yamada Cram School"\NYeah. Brings back memories, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yamada Cram School"\NYamada Cram School...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like we did much cramming...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They called it a school,\Nbut it was basically a place
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for working parents to leave their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, you, and Shuichi.\NAnd Mrs. Yamada was still alive then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi! It went over to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you guys be studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Kaito!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see that, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Naoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice to see everyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get in touch with\Neveryone right? Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Still got that pretty face, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're still as loud as ever, Aiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Naoto!\NYou're my boyfriend; stand up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you do make a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem all that different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're going for a top college, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the skills to get\Ninto any college, no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with Honoka? She's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. You didn't hear about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka's dad got into some trouble\Nin Tokyo and was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it was hard for\Nher around here, after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"You should die" "Get out"\N"Demon" "You will pay"\NI guess it was hard for\Nher around here, after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"You should die" "Get out"\N"Demon" "You will pay"\NShe just kind of disappeared one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She just kind of disappeared one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't anyone tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:06:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I thought you hated gossip like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're all together,\Nwhy don't we go to karaoke or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Naoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to say this, Kaito...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think you should try\Nto forget about Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't say anything to us, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think she wants us to look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what Aiko said.\NBut I had to find out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the stuff happened with her dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:07:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka was taken in by\Nsome relatives in a nearby town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She just up and disappeared one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We reported it to the police...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you find her, could you tell her this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a clue somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're all together, why don't\Nwe go to karaoke or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The way she twirled her hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka always did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nthat was a weird thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think you should try\Nto forget about Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's already gone home... Kaito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hotel Mythos"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,An alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you bring us out here so late?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of having to do\Nthis every time... but here's proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Aiko we know now is a transformed Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Transformed? What the hell\Nare you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Naoto, you noticed something was out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you mentioned it to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned Honoka into Aiko.\NAs thanks for this coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins... Wishes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all true?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was her wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted to erase herself\Nand become someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Naoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am telling you because\NI heard you were her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer you didn't make a big deal out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If her story gets out,\Npeople will probably come for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I will be forced to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If it comes to that,\NI can't say what might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka is Aiko now...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all true, then where is the real Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.45,0:10:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka was in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko had everything that Honoka wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She was taken in by her relatives\Nbut was never accepted by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,With the alien's help, she turned into\NAiko in attempt to gain all that Aiko had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Honoka would...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any other way to explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go to the cops with the alien here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Honoka did commit some crime,\Nshe should pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We know the truth, and we spent time with them--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones who can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Honoka was so kind,\NI just can't believe she'd do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So then where is the real Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Stay home! Bitch"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Stop what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:12:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Naoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend isn't really your girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that. But I stick by what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you know, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka might be Aiko now,\Nbut she's not causing any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we ignore the alien's warning\Nand something happens? What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing needs to change...\NJust like normal... If we just stay quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,everything will stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Naoto!\N--I agree with Naoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You do too, don't you Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay with how that ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think things should stay as they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If that won't hurt you... or the others... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything... will stay the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere, Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Brings back memories, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:14:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the building really this small?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt so much bigger back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. We're the ones that changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that where you buried Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me. You're Honoka, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your twirling.\NYou always used to twirl your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that was enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka... Can't you go back\Nto who you used to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... She doesn't even exist anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.91,0:15:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena... What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They found Aiko's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:16:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was written a while ago.\NIn Aiko's handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was addressed to Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was addressed to Honoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka... didn't kill Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. The real Aiko killed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I kill Honoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you... sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said, right?\NThat you'd grant my wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I did... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I want you to turn me into someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A very dear friend died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A person with a strong sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing that kind of thing really pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, there's no way I'll give in to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Stay home! Bitch"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She was my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late.\NI'm the only one that knows she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She was really loved by everyone.\NIf she's gone, everyone will be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I disappear, nobody will be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.29,0:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Naoto had somehow realized\Nthat Aiko killed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So did Shuichi and Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.95,0:18:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They all thought it'd be fine\Nif everything wrapped up the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody minded that Honoka disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... She doesn't even exist anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. That's why I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I couldn't just let Honoka disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was the only one\Nthat didn't want her to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I killed Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can all disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"New Palace Pachinko"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"New Palace Pachinko"\NDid you hear the rumor about the glowing girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A glowing girl stands on\Na path and asks "Who am I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell her her name, you get erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You get erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But you guys met the alien\Nand heard about the coins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like something\Ncrazy is happening in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When we talked about it before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If we just stay quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,everything will stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I pretended not to know. But that was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fault, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaito is plotting something,\Nthen I'll use the coin's power...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yamada Cram School"\N"Present Day"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yamada Cram School"\N"Present Day"\NDid you go to Yamada Cram School\Nwhen you were little?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Did you go to Yamada Cram School\Nwhen you were little?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to see you hanging out\Nwith all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. I never hung out\Nwith anyone at cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi's past...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:21:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we meet up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she did it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you again. It's Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 13: We Two Are One"
